MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977098-004-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977098-004', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'First report: Jordan Lee / Harborview Community Health, DOI Dec 27, State Insurance Fund. clmt says he backed work van into bollard in lot at facility parking area. reported to Paula Kowalski same day. sx: bruising and swelling, shin tender to touch. treating at North Shore Occupational Health w/ Dr Fischer. the company sent C-2F, rec\'d Jan 2. dx per first visit: contusion. no prior claims that I can see. clmt still working, light tasks only. C-3 not yet rec\'d. we have not rec\'d any wage info yet. company says clmt has worked there a while, no prior injuries per Rita Haddad. coverage confirmed, State Insurance Fund is on the risk. we need the job description and wage statement from company. wage info still needed.\nDOI Dec 27, clmt backed work van into a bollard in lot at facility parking area. On modified duty from Dec 29.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 834, n.word_count = 147;
