MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977100-043-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977100-043', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Rehab note visit 3 of 6. Tolerated tx well. Pt reports hand swelling, pain w/ gripping. Pain 4/10 pre-tx, 3/10 after. Did wrist ROM, grip strengthening, putty + ice. ROM: Wrist ROM limited by pain, grip weak. Strength 4/5. Reviewed HEP, pt demonstrates correctly. Pt arrived early, no problems.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 294, n.word_count = 49;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977100-044-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977100-044', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Spoke with Marcus Reed 12/17/25. Says he saw Dr Osei on November 25. Taking tylenol as needed. Working w/ restrictions. Marcus confirmed DOI 11/21/2025 at service site. Asked about mileage reimbursement, told to send C-257 with receipts. Asked if Priya is still the adjuster, confirmed. Marcus got a bill for $447.75 from Brooklyn Occupational Medicine, I told him not to pay it, we will check it. Asked him to call Carla Lindqvist about the light duty at the company.\nDOI 11/21/25, Marcus tripped on something on the floor and went down at service site.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 554, n.word_count = 94;
