MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977100-055-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977100-055', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '12/30/25 Board update: Conciliation conference is on 01/09/2026. Claim 6977100, conciliation conference. Copy to Wesco Insurance Co and the company. Marcus Reed asked if he has to attend - told to check the notice. Nothing else scheduled that I can see. Marcus notified by letter. The IME report needs to be in by then.\nDOI 11/21/25, Marcus tripped on something on the floor and went down at service site. First seen at Brooklyn Occupational Medicine on 25NOV25, dx hand injury of the right hand, xray neg.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 506, n.word_count = 86;
