MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977118-082-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977118-082', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Subject: Status Report - Claim 6977118 - Nina Foster\nHi Beth,\n\nPlease see the update below on Nina Foster\'s claim (Orange Supply Cooperative, DOI Dec 27, office stairwell). I have kept the history short, call me if you want more.\n\nCLAIM HISTORY\nDOI Dec 27, Nina Foster got the low back and both shoulders caught between a pallet and a rack handling stock at office stairwell. First seen at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center on Jan 1, dx sprain of the low back and both shoulders, lumbar xray no acute findings. PT at Lakeview Physical Therapy started 1/12/26, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered Jan 19, result Jan 29: mild disc bulge L4-5, no stenosis. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,415 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Elena Cruz, ER contact Lena Brandt, ER supervisor Greg Sato, treating Dr Whitaker, PT Lena Castillo at Lakeview Physical Therapy. Coverage: Police on the risk, Kings county, office stairwell.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 941, n.word_count = 161;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977118-082-C02'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977118-082', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 2, n.text = 'CURRENT MEDICAL: treating with Dr Whitaker at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center. Pain was 0/10 at the last visit (Mar 13) and Nina reports feeling much better, occasional soreness. Restrictions: released to full duty, no restrictions.\nWORK STATUS: Nina is back to full duty.\nBENEFITS: no lost time, no wage benefits due at this point. Medical bills are being paid per the fee schedule.\nLEGAL: no hearings or conciliation set, nothing from the Board that needs a response.\nCONTACTS: adjuster Elena Cruz, ER contact Lena Brandt (Orange Supply Cooperative), ER supervisor Greg Sato, treating Dr Whitaker at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center. PT is Lena Castillo at Lakeview Physical Therapy.\nCOVERAGE: Police is on the risk. Claim is in Kings county, injury location office stairwell. No prior claims found on Nina.\nOUTSTANDING: nothing.\nRESERVES: no change recommended right now, med reserve $6,000. We will revisit after the next medical report.\nPLAN: continue to monitor, speak with Nina and the company again this month, and send the next update by 06/10/2026. Please let me know if you need anything else in the meantime.\n\nThanks,\nElena Cruz', n.char_start = 943, n.char_end = 2076, n.word_count = 185;
