MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977118-094-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977118-094', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'File review Aug 17. Nina has a sprain of the low back and both shoulders from Dec 27, claim is open. Nina is seeing Dr Whitaker at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center and last reported pain at 0/10, no complaints. Restrictions are: Released to full duty, no restrcitions. Nina is back to full duty. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: Continue to monitor, next review Sep 7.\nDOI Dec 27, Nina got the low back and both shoulders caught between a pallet and a rack handling stock at office stairwell. First seen at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center on Jan 1, dx sprain of the low back and both shoulders, lumbar xray no acute findings. PT at Lakeview PT started Jan 12, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered Jan 19, result Jan 29: Mild disc bulge L4-5, no stejosis.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 792, n.word_count = 148;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977118-095-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977118-095', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'per email, will f/u\nFrom: Frank (front desk) <frank@upstatejointrehabcenter.example>\nSent: Tue, Aug 18, 2026 16:25\nTo: Elena Cruz\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977118 - Foster\n\nHi Elena,\nOur billing for $114.00 was sent on 03/13/2026, please confirm receipt.\nNext visit is scheduled for prn.\nNina Foster is being seen for sprain of the low back and both shoulders.\n\nThank you,\nFrank (front desk)', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 385, n.word_count = 62;
