MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977121-029-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977121-029', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Spoke with Leo Morgan . Asked about the status of the claim, explained it is open, no Board date yet. Worried about employer cutting hours. Working regular duty, no issues. Leo confirmed DOI December 19 at warehouse. Said he was repositioning stock and felt a pull.\nDOI December 19, Leo was repositioning stock and felt a pull at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occ Health on December 24, dx strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder, xray neg. Still waiting on records from prior provider.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 500, n.word_count = 87;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977121-030-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977121-030', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Rx checck 01/08/2026: No early refill issue.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 44, n.word_count = 7;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977121-031-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977121-031', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Outbound call to Leo. Leo Morgan states neck, upper back and shoulder sore and stiff. Asked who pays for Capital Region Occupational Health visits, told Hartford Casualty Insurance Co pays per fee schedule and to keep receipts. Said he was repositioning stock and felt a pull. Still hard to reach overhead or lift. Address and phone confirmed same as file. Asked if Daniel is still the adjuster, confirmed. Advised to keep appts.\nDOI December 19, Leo was repositioning stock and felt a pull at warehouse.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 504, n.word_count = 85;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977121-032-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977121-032', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'January 14 - Capital Region Occupational Health called. Dr Lindqvist\'s office says next appt 1/26.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 98, n.word_count = 15;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977121-033-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977121-033', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '16JAN26 pharmacy note (Harbor Drug): Leo paid out of pocket $62.00, asked for reimbursement.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 92, n.word_count = 14;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977121-034-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977121-034', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'File review January 26. Leo has a strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder from December 19, claim is open, no Board date yet. Leo is seeing Dr Lindqvist at Capital Region Occ Health and last reported pain at 4/10, pain in the neck, worse by end of shift. Restr are: No overhead work, lifting to 15 lbs. Leo is back to full duty. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Records from prior provider. Plan: Continue to monitor, next review February 16.\nDOI December 19, Leo was repositioning stock and felt a pull at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occupational Health on December 24, dx strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder, xray neg. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $465 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Victor Alvarez, ER supervisor Alicia Whitaker, treating Dr Lindqvist.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 838, n.word_count = 146;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977121-035-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977121-035', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'OFFICE NOTE January 26 (Dr Lindqvist): Restr: No overhead work, lifting to 15 lbs.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 82, n.word_count = 14;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977121-036-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977121-036', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'January 26 reserves - Daniel\'s file: med reserve $22,000. reserves unchanged. increased med reserve bc hearing scheduled. Daniel requested more authority. ok to send status report. paid to date approx $15,000. we should revisit after next medical.\nDOI December 19, EE was repositioning stock and felt a pull at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occ Health on December 24, dx strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder, xray neg. no wage payments, medical bills only, approx $465 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Victor Alvarez, ER supervisor Alicia Whitaker, treating Dr Lindqvist. Coverage: Hartford Casualty Insurance Co on the risk, Queens county, warehouse. still waiting on records from prior provider. -CJ', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 744, n.word_count = 116;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977121-037-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977121-037', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Need to respond to this.\nFrom: Victor Alvarez <victor@lakesidecoffeeretail.example>\nSent: Mon, Jan 26, 2026 7:27\nTo: Daniel Brooks\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977121 - Morgan\n\nHi Daniel,\nAttached is the wage statement for Leo Morgan.\nPlease confirm whether the claim has been accepted.\nOur insurer is Hartford Casualty Insurance Co, adjuster is Daniel.\n\nThank you,\nVictor Alvarez', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 371, n.word_count = 56;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977121-038-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977121-038', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Checked eCase, nothing new. Will call Capital Region Occupational Health if nothing by February 4.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 98, n.word_count = 15;
