MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977137-043-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977137-043', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '2/4/26 - spoke with Noah by phone. Says he saw Dr Sato on 1/19/26. Wants a copy of the C-3, will mail. Cx confirmed DOI 12/23/2025 at retail store. Asked when the next check is due, told Noah checks are $657.00/wk. Address and phone confirmed same as file. Cx says he is not sure he can do the light duty offered, I told him to talk to Dr Sato.\nDOI 12/23/25, cx tripped on something on the floor and went down at retail store. First seen at Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab on 12/29/25, dx sprain of the right knee, xray neg for fracture.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 533, n.word_count = 104;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977137-044-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977137-044', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'February 4 outbound call to Noah. Asked if Olivia is still the adjuster confirmed.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 82, n.word_count = 14;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977137-045-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977137-045', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Subject: Status Report - Claim 6977137 - Noah Bennett\nHi Sam,\n\nPlease see the update below on Noah Bennett\'s claim (Buffalo Care Network, DOI 12/23/25, retail store). I have kept the history short, call me if you want more.\n\nCLAIM HISTORY\nDOI 12/23/25, Noah tripped on something on the floor and went down at retail store. First seen at Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab on 12/29/25, dx sprain of the right knee, xray neg for fracture. Off work from 12/25/25. On modified duty from 1/10/26. PT at Summit Rehab & Sports PT started 1/5/26, 9 of 18 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered 1/13/26, result 1/24/26: mild effusion, possible meniscus signal change. Admin determination notice 1/22/26. Weekly payments of $657 started Jan 3, approx $3,285 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Olivia Grant, ER contact Mei Doyle, ER supervisor Nora Okafor, treating Dr Sato, PT Dev Whitaker at Summit Rehab & Sports PT.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 903, n.word_count = 153;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977137-045-C02'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977137-045', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 2, n.text = 'CURRENT MEDICAL: treating with Dr Sato at Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab. Pain was 7/10 at the last visit (1/19/26) and cx reports knee swelling, feels unstable on stairs. Restrictions: no standing over 2 hrs, no ladders, no kneeling.\nWORK STATUS: Noah is working modified duty.\nBENEFITS: we are paying $657.00/wk.\nLEGAL: no hearings or conciliation set, nothing from the Board that needs a response.\nCONTACTS: adjuster Olivia Grant, ER contact Mei Doyle (Buffalo Care Network), ER supervisor Nora Okafor, treating Dr Sato at Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab. PT is Dev Whitaker at Summit Rehab & Sports PT.\nCOVERAGE: State Ins Fund is on the risk. Claim is in Franklin county, injury location retail store. No prior claims found on cx.\nOUTSTANDING: records from prior provider.\nRESERVES: no change recommended right now, med reserve $15,000. We will revisit after the next medical report.\nPLAN: continue to monitor, speak with cx and the employer again this month, and send the next update by 2/27/26. Please let me know if you need anything else in the meantime.\n\nThanks,\nOlivia Grant', n.char_start = 905, n.char_end = 1983, n.word_count = 179;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977137-046-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977137-046', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Rx chck 2/6/26: Refill request for naproxen -AK', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 47, n.word_count = 8;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977137-047-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977137-047', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'PT visit 9/18 2/6/26 (Summit Rehab & Sports PT). Pt reports knee swelling, feels unstable on stairs. Pain 7/10 pre-tx, 7/10 after. Progressing w/ HEP. Missed last appt, rescheduled. ROM: Knee/ankle ROM near full, some pain at end range. Strength 4+/5. Pt asked if more visits will be approved. Will reassess at visit 12.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 320, n.word_count = 54;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977137-048-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977137-048', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'bill rvw (Olivia): PT visits from Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab $427.75 pended for records EE called worried about a bill from MedQuick Pharmacy $402.50 reduced to fee schedule $235.00 -GR', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 186, n.word_count = 31;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977137-049-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977137-049', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '2/10/26 work status: Cx is working w/ restrictions. Restr per Dr Sato: No standing over 2 hrs, no ladders, no kneeling. Cx did 3 days of modified duty then called out. Mei Doyle says light duty available, hours reduced. Full duty release expected 2/12. Cx says he isnt ready, pain 7/10. Cx worried about the commute. The employer should have the new restrictions in writing.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 374, n.word_count = 65;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977137-050-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977137-050', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '2/11/26 therapy session #10 - Dev Whitaker, PT Missed last appt, rescheduled Pt asked if more visits will be approved.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 118, n.word_count = 20;
