MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-006-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-006', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Dec 4 outbound call to Maya working regular duty, no issues asked about mileage reimbursement, told to send C-257 w/ receipts asked her to call Lena Castillo about light duty at company', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 185, n.word_count = 32;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-007-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-007', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Called Hudson Valley Hospitality, spoke w/ Nora Brennan. company wants to know if the claim is accepted, told them it is open, no Board date yet. Nora Brennan says clmt has been fine, no problems lately. company says clmt missed 7 days last month. Lena Castillo says no other injuries like this at site. told Lena Castillo we cant discuss reserves. payroll has not sent the wage statement.\nDOI Dec 2, Maya was struck by a coworker during pallet move at facility parking area.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 475, n.word_count = 84;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-008-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-008', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Dr Brennan\'s office. asked Dr Brennan for an updated work status, fax request sent.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 83, n.word_count = 14;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-009-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-009', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Incident statment (Nora Brennan, 12/08/2025): I was on shift 12/02/2025. Maya Patel told me she was struck by a coworker during a pallet move.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 142, n.word_count = 24;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-010-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-010', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'recorded statement clmt Dec 8: clmt states she was struck by a coworker during a pallet move at facility parking area around 10 am. asked Maya if she had any trouble w/ upper arm before, said no. clmt has been w/ the company a few years, regular schedule. clmt says she told Nora Brennan before end of the shift. clmt drove home, went to Rochester Work Injury Clinic the next morning.\nDOI Dec 2, clmt was struck by a coworker during a pallet move at facility parking area.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 472, n.word_count = 88;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-011-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-011', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Dec 8 Northeast Diagnostic Imaging report rec\'d. xray neg.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 58, n.word_count = 9;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-012-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-012', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'text msg rec\'d Dec 9 from Maya: my upper arm still hurts when i reach overhead or lift. nobody called me back about wage statement from ER. i have a bill from Lakeview Pharmacy. i sent the forms last week did you get them. tylenol is not really helping. i need to know who to talk to about mileage. thx', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 302, n.word_count = 60;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-013-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-013', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'OFFICE NOTE 12/09/2025 (Dr Brennan): Exam: Pain w/ resisted motion. Xray neg. Meds: Tylenol prn. Pt states compliant w/ tx. ROM: ROM improving, still guarded overhead. C-4.2 to follow. Pt asks about reach overhead or lift, advised to modify. Continue pendulums, scapular stabilization, theraband rows. F/u 12/22.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 312, n.word_count = 47;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-014-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-014', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Dec 10 called Rochester Work Injury Clinic for records, 5-7 business days. asked Dr Brennan for an updated work status, fax request sent. Rochester Work Injury Clinic billing called about a denied visit, referred to State Ins Fund. Rochester Work Injury Clinic rec\'d our auth, visits scheduled. Rochester Work Injury Clinic says clmt no showed last appt. need the C-4.2 from Dr Brennan. Dr Brennan wants clmt to continue pendulums, scapular stabilization, theraband rows. Rochester Work Injury Clinic sent a bill for $293.50, forwarded to bill review', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 550, n.word_count = 87;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-015-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-015', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'called clmt, reached on 2nd try. pain about 6/10 today per clmt. worried about company cutting hours. still hard to reach overhead or lift', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 138, n.word_count = 24;
