MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-074-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-074', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'April 27 sup review - Maya: set reserve review for 30 days refer to Mike for case mgmt send status report to SIF by May 5 dont close until Board notice is rec\'d pull prior claim history again ok to approve PT -CJ', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 212, n.word_count = 43;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-075-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-075', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Subject: Status Report - Claim 6977140 - Maya Patel\nHi Greg,\n\nPlease see the update below on Maya Patel\'s claim (Hudson Valley Hospitality, DOI Dec 2, facility parking area). I have kept the history short, call me if you want more.\n\nCLAIM HISTORY\nDOI Dec 2, clmt was struck by a coworker during a pallet move at facility parking area. First seen at Rochester Work Injury Clinic on Dec 8, dx strain of the lt uppper arm, xray neg. PT at Lakeview Physical Therapy started Dec 19, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,470 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Maya Patel, ER contact Lena Castillo, ER supervisor Nora Brennan, treating Dr Brennan, PT Hector Osei at Lakeview Physical Therapy. Coverage: State Insurance Fund on the risk, Queens county, facility parking area.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 816, n.word_count = 140;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-075-C02'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-075', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 2, n.text = 'CURRENT MEDICAL: treating with Dr Brennan at Rochester Work Injury Clinic. Pain was 0/10 at the last visit (Mar 3) and clmt reports mild stiffness only. Restrictions: released to full duty, no restrictions.\nWORK STATUS: clmt is back to full duty.\nBENEFITS: no lost time, no wage benefits due at this point. Medical bills are being paid per the fee schedule.\nLEGAL: no hearings or conciliation set, nothing from the Board that needs a response.\nCONTACTS: adjuster Maya Patel, ER contact Lena Castillo (Hudson Valley Hospitality), ER supervisor Nora Brennan, treating Dr Brennan at Rochester Work Injury Clinic. PT is Hector Osei at Lakeview Physical Therapy.\nCOVERAGE: State Insurance Fund is on the risk. Claim is in Queens county, injury location facility parking area. No prior claims found on clmt.\nOUTSTANDING: nothing.\nRESERVES: no change recommended right now, med reserve $15,000. We will revisit after the next medical report.\nPLAN: continue to monitor, speak with clmt and the company again this month, and send the next update by May 31. Please let me know if you need anything else in the meantime.\n\nThanks,\nMaya Patel', n.char_start = 818, n.char_end = 1947, n.word_count = 185;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-076-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-076', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'clmt, lt upper arm strain, DOI Dec 2. file is open, no Board date yet. seeing Dr Brennan at Rochester Work Injury Clinic; pain 0/10 per last note; feeling much better, occasional soreness. working regular duty, no issues; restr: released to full duty, no restrictions. no Board activity. nothing. call clmt, f/u w/ Dr Brennan, review again May 22. DOI Dec 2, clmt was struck by coworker during pallet move at facility parking area. first seen at Rochester Work Injury Clinic on Dec 8, dx strain of the lt upper arm, xray neg. PT at Lakeview Physical Therapy started Dec 19, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. no wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,470 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Maya Patel, ER contact Lena Castillo, ER supervisor Nora Brennan, treating Dr Brennan, PT Hector Osei at Lakeview Physical Therapy. Coverage: SIF on the risk, Queens county, facility parking area.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 895, n.word_count = 152;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977140-077-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977140-077', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'see below. -WP\nFrom: Kevin (front desk) <kevin@rochesterworkinjuryclinic.example>\nSent: Wed, May 13, 2026 17:32\nTo: Maya Patel\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977140 - Patel\n\nHi Maya,\nPlease confirm authorization for the xray.\nAttached is the note from Maya Patel\'s visit on Mar 3.\nWe are requesting 12 PT visits, please advise.\n\nThanks,\nKevin (front desk)', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 344, n.word_count = 54;
