MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977144-066-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977144-066', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'File review 3/4/26. Priya has a contusion of the neck and low back from 12/26/25, claim is still open. Priya is seeing Dr Okafor at Empire Physical Medicine and last reported pain at 1/10, sore all over, stiff in the mornings. Restrictions are: Lifting up to 30 lbs ok, no prolonged bending. Priya is working regular duty, no issues. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: Call Priya, follow up with Dr Okafor, review again 3/18/26.\nDOI 12/26/25, Priya tripped on something on the floor and went down at service site. First seen at Empire Physical Medicine on 12/30/25, dx contusion of the neck and low back, lumbar xray no acute findings. On modified duty from 12/29/25. Back to full duty from 2/22/26. PT at Riverbend Physical Therapy started 1/12/26, 10 of 12 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered 1/26/26, result 2/7/26: Mild disc bulge L4-5, no stenosis. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,220 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Priya Shah, ER contact Paula Nakamura, ER supervisor Tasha Okafor, treating Dr Okafor, PT Victor Haddad at Riverbend Physical Therapy. Coverage: Wegmans Food Markets on the risk, Monroe county, service site.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 1181, n.word_count = 197;
