MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-010-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-010', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'North Shore Occ Health f/u 12/26/25.\nSUBJECTIVE: pt c/o low back, hip and both knees sore and stiff. pain 6/10.\nOBJECTIVE: paraspinal spasm, FROM limited. lumbar xray no acute findings. ROM: lumbar flexion limited, extension ok.\nASSESSMENT: strain of the low back, hip and both knees, no change.\nPLAN: ice, heat, nsaids. restr: no lifting over 10 lbs, no repeated bending. work status: still off work. f/u 1/12.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 411, n.word_count = 68;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-011-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-011', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'rec\'d this today, will call. -MH\nFrom: Greg (front desk) <greg@northshoreoccupationalhealth.example>\nSent: Fri, Dec 26, 2025 16:51\nTo: Marcus Hill\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977156 - Rivera\n\nHi Marcus,\nEmma Rivera is being seen for strain of the low back, hip and both knees.\nWork status: remains off work per the Dr.\nWe are requesting 6 PT visits, please advise.\n\nThanks,\nGreg (front desk)', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 383, n.word_count = 63;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-012-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-012', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'SUP STMT 12/29/25 - Greg Romano. I was on shift 12/21/25. Emma Rivera told me she missed the last few steps and fell. Location was operations facility. Emma finished the shift but was favoring it. I offered to call an ambulance, she said no. The floor was dry that day as far as i know. Signed Greg Romano\nDOI 12/21/25, Emma missed the last few steps and fell at operations facility. First seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 12/25/25, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 520, n.word_count = 95;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-013-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-013', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'recorded statement IW 12/29/2025: IW states she missed last few steps and fell at operations facility around 8:30am. no one saw it, a coworker came over after. she reported to Greg Romano right away, told to see North Shore Occupational Health. denies prior problems w/ low back, hip and both knees. dominant hand is the right. asked IW if she had any trouble with low back, hip and both knees before, said no. IW has been w/ employer a few years, regular schedule. IW says she told Greg Romano before end of shift. IW says nobody has offered light duty yet. asked about any activities outside work, nothing unusual.\nDOI 12/21/2025, IW missed the last few steps and fell at operations facility. first seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 12/25/2025, dx strain of low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. Off work from 12/22/2025. Lena Alvarez is the worker\'s attorney. still waiting on wage statement from employer and initial medical report from North Shore Occupational Health.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 1005, n.word_count = 171;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-014-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-014', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'S/W IW . ASKED IF MARCUS IS STILL THE ADJUSTER, CONFIRMED. -MH', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 62, n.word_count = 12;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-015-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-015', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '12/30/2025 - s/w IW by phone. IW confirmed DOI 12/21/2025 at operations facility. said she missed the last few steps and fell. asked about mileage reimbursement, told to send C-257 w/ receipts. asked when the next check is due, told IW checks are $710.00/wk. address and phone confirmed same as file. Emma got a bill for $410 from North Shore Occupational Health, I told her not to pay it, we will check it.\nDOI 12/21/2025, IW missed last few steps and fell at operations facility. -MH', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 485, n.word_count = 86;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-016-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-016', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'VM from Emma: nobody called me back abojt initial medical report from North Shore Occupational Health. when is my next payment. i sent forms last week did you get them. my number changed, new one is on file now. tylenol is not really helping. do i need to go to IME, i dont have a ride. thx -Tina', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 296, n.word_count = 58;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-017-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-017', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '12/31/2025 pmt note (Marcus): Clmt called abouut a late check, $436.75 outstanding. Direct deposit set up for clmt.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 115, n.word_count = 18;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-018-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-018', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '01/02/2026 called North Shore Occupational Health for records, 5-7 business days. asked DR Haddad for an updated work status, fax request sent. North Shore Occupational Health billing called about denied visit, referred to State Ins Fund. North Shore Occupational Health says IW no showed the last appt. records rec\'d from North Shore Occupational Health, 10 pages. need C-4.2 from DR Haddad. DR Haddad wants IW to continue core stabilization, hamstring stretching, bridging. North Shore Occupational Health sent bill for $175.75, forwarded to bill review. -MH', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 560, n.word_count = 85;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-019-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-019', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'compensability 01/05/2026: disputing for now, we need causation support, C-7 sent to the Board. lost time over 7 days, wage benefits due. will revisit once medical comes in. IW\'s account is consistent w/ DR Haddad\'s first note. we will diary for the wage statement. no signs of prior injury in the records so far.\nDOI 12/21/2025, IW missed last few steps and fell at operations facility. first seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 12/25/2025, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. -MH', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 530, n.word_count = 91;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-020-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-020', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Case mgr note (Susan): Pt reports low back, hip and both knees sore and stiff. Reviewed restrictions: No lifting over 10 lbs, no repeated bending. Barrier to RTW: Pain w/ driving. Pt agreed to f/u appt 1/12. Med adherence ok (tylenol). ER contact: Tasha Kowalski. Pain 6/10 per pt. Pt attended 1 of 6 PT visits so far.\nDOI 12/21/25, Emma Rivera missed the last few steps and fell at operations facility. First seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 12/25/25, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 540, n.word_count = 96;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-021-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-021', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '01/06/2026 NO ACTIVITY DIARY +30. WILL CALL NORTH SHORE OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH IF NOTHING BY 01/15/2026. -MH', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 105, n.word_count = 16;
