MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-055-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-055', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '03/03/2026 Board update: hearing held 03/03/2026, adjourned for medical records. claim 6977156, hearing before the judge. IW asked if she has to attend - told to check the notice. Marcus aware. nothing else scheduled that I can see. IW notified by letter.\nDOI 12/21/2025, IW missed last few steps and fell at operations facility. first seen at North Shore Occupational Health on Dec 25, dx strain of low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. Off work from 12/22/2025. On modified duty from 01/15/2026 -MH', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 523, n.word_count = 88;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-056-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-056', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '03/04/2026 Board notice rec\'d. hearing held 03/03/2026, adjourned for IME report. claim 6977156, hearing before judge. copy to State Ins Fund and employer. IW asked if she has to attend - told to check notice. Marcus aware. nothing else scheduled that I can see. IW notified by letter. the IME report needs to be in by then.\nDOI 12/21/2025, IW missed the last few steps and fell at operations facility. first seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 12/25/2025, dx strain of low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. Off work from 12/22/2025. On modified duty from 01/15/2026. PT at Summit Rehab & Sports PT started Jan 6, 13 of 16 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered 01/12/2026, result 01/24/2026: mild disc bulge L4-5, no stenosis. Lena Alvarez is the worker\'s attorney. hearing held 03/03/2026. Weekly payments of $710 started 12/31/2025, approx $6,390 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Marcus Hill, ER contact Tasha Kowalski, ER supervisor Greg Romano, treating DR Haddad, PT Lena Mehta at Summit Rehab & Sports PT. Coverage: State Ins Fund on risk, Queens county, operations facility -MH', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 1119, n.word_count = 186;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-057-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-057', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'PT visit 14/16 March 5 (Summit Rehab & Sports PT). Pain 4/10 pre-tx 4/10 after. Did core stabilization hamstring stretching bridging + ice. ROM: Lumbar flexion limited extension ok. Pt arrived late shortened session. Goal: Lift 30 lbs floor to waist. Pt asked if more visits will be approved. Reviewed HEP pt demonstrates correctly. Auth pending w/ State Insurance Fund.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 370, n.word_count = 60;
