MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-064-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-064', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'STATUS: IW, low back, hip and both knees strain, DOI Dec 21. file is open.\nMEDICAL: seeing DR Haddad at North Shore Occupational Health; pain 4/10 per last note; pain in the low back, worse by end of shift.\nWORK: back on light duty; restr: no lifting over 20 lbs, limit bending.\nPAY: paying $710.00/wk, approx $7,810 paid to date.\nLEGAL: hearing held 03/03/2026, adjourned for the attorney to submit position.\nPENDING: nothing.\nPLAN: call Emma, follow up with DR Haddad, review again 04/03/2026.\nHISTORY: DOI 12/21/2025, IW missed the last few steps and fell at operations facility. First seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 12/25/2025, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. Off work from 12/22/2025. On modified duty from 01/15/2026. PT at Summit Rehab & Sports PT started 01/06/2026, 16 of 16 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered 01/12/2026, result 01/24/2026: mild disc bulge L4-5, no stenosis. IME with Dr Iyer on 3-5-2026, report 03/20/2026 says supports a work-related injury, no ongoing disability. Lena Alvarez is the worker\'s attorney. Hearing held 03/03/2026. Weekly payments of $710 started 12/31/2025, approx $7,810 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Marcus Hill, ER contact Tasha Kowalski, ER supervisor Greg Romano, treating DR Haddad, PT Lena Mehta at Summit Rehab & Sports PT. Coverage: State Insurance Fund on the risk, Queens county, operations facility.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 1423, n.word_count = 230;
