MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-103-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-103', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'STATUS: Emma, low back, hip and both knees strain, DOI 12/21/2025. file is still open.\nMEDICAL: seeing DR Haddad at North Shore Occupational Health; pain 2/10 per last note; sore all over, stiff in the mornings.\nWORK: back to full duty; restr: lifting up to 30 lbs ok, no prolonged bending.\nPAY: no lost time, no wage payments, medical bills only.\nLEGAL: judge\'s decision rec\'d after the 04/14/2026 hearing, nothing more needed from us.\nPENDING: nothing.\nPLAN: continue to monitor, next review 07/16/2026.\nHISTORY: DOI 12/21/25, IW missed the last few steps and fell at operations facility. First seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 12/25/2025, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. Off work from 12/22/2025. On modified duty from 01/15/2026. Back to full duty from 05/30/2026. PT at Summit Rehab & Sports PT started 01/06/2026, 16 of 16 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered 1/12/26, result 01/24/2026: mild disc bulge L4-5, no stenosis. IME with Dr Iyer on 03/05/2026, report 03/20/2026 says supports a work-related injury, no ongoing disability. Lena Alvarez is the worker\'s attorney. Hearing held 03/03/2026. Second hearing 04/14/2026. Weekly payments of $710 started 12/31/2025, approx $17,750 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Marcus Hill, ER contact Tasha Kowalski, ER supervisor Greg Romano, treating DR Haddad, PT Lena Mehta at Summit Rehab & Sports PT. Coverage: State Ins Fund on the risk, Queens county, operations facility.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 1487, n.word_count = 238;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977156-104-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977156-104', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'need to respond to this -MH\nFrom: Lena Alvarez <lena@alvarezlaw.example>\nSent: Tue, Jun 30, 2026 17:16\nTo: Marcus Hill\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977156 - Rivera\n\nHi Marcus,\nPlease provide a copy of the IME report.\nMy client is available for a call, my office number is on file.\n\nRegards,\nLena Alvarez', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 294, n.word_count = 51;
