MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-004-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-004', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Dec 10 prior claims search done, no hits -Jamal', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 47, n.word_count = 9;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-005-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-005', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'First report: Chloe Nguyen / City Operations Dept, DOI December 9, SIF. Chloe Nguyen says she was hit at an intersection driving the company vehicle at warehouse. Reported to Ravi Brandt same day. Sx: Low back, hip and both knees sore and stiff. Dx per first visit: Strain. No prior claims that I can see. We have not received any wage info yet. Coverage confirmed, SIF is on the risk. We need the job descripttion and wage statement from employer. Diary 14 days.\nDOI December 9, Chloe was hit at an intersection driving the company vehicle at warehouae.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 554, n.word_count = 98;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-006-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-006', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '12-10-2025 no activity, diary +30. Last med report December 10. No concerns re: Compliance. Will call Upstate Hearing & Balance Center if nothing by 12/16/2025.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 160, n.word_count = 25;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-007-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-007', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Forwarding to file.\nFrom: Frank Nakamura <frank@cityoperationsdepartment.example>\nSent: Thu, Dec 11, 2025 9:34\nTo: Daniel Brooks\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977160 - Nguyen\n\nHi Daniel,\nPlease confirm whether the clim has been accepted.\nOur payroll shows Chloe Nguyen earned about $690 a week before the injury.\n\nThanks,\nFrank Nakamura', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 326, n.word_count = 48;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-008-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-008', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Called Chloe Nguyen, reached on 2nd try. Asked who pays for Upstate Hearing & Balance Center visits, told State Insurance Fund pays per fee schedule and too keep receipts. Worried about employer cutting hours. Asked about mileage reimbursement, told to send C-257 with receipts. Trouble sleeping because of the pain. Address and phone confirmed same as file. Asked if Daniel is still the adjuster, confirmed. Chloe says she is not sure she can do the light duty offered, I told her to talk to Dr Haddad. Chloe got a bill for $403.75 from Upstate Hearing & Balance Center, I told her not to pay it, we will check it. Chloe understood. next appt 12/14.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 650, n.word_count = 114;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-009-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-009', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Called Upstate Hearing & Balance Center for records, 5-7 business days.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 71, n.word_count = 11;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-010-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-010', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Dr note rec\'d 12/12/25 from Upstate Hearing & Balance Center: Pt c/o low back, hip and both knees sore and stiff. Pain 6/10. Lumbar xray no acute findings. Restr: No lifting over 10 lbs, no repeated bending. Work status: Back on light duty. ROM: Lumbar flexion limited, extension ok. RTC 12/29.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 294, n.word_count = 51;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-011-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-011', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Work status: Restr per Dr Haddad: No lifting over 10 lbs, no repeated bending. Chloe Nguyen worried about the commute. Employer should have the new restr in writing.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 165, n.word_count = 28;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-012-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-012', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'tried clmt again, VM full -Jamal', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 32, n.word_count = 6;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-013-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-013', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Spoke with Chloe Nguyen . Address and phone confirmed same as file.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 67, n.word_count = 12;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-014-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-014', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Statement 12/15/2025 from Ravi Brandt at City Operations Department: I was on shift 12/09/2025. Chloe told me she was hit at an intersection driving the company vehicle. I did not see it happen. Incident form given to Frank Nakamura. We have a camera but not sure it covers warehouse. No prior complaints that i recall. Chloe finished the shift but was favoring it. I offered to call an ambulance, she said no. The floor was dry that day as far as i know. Chloe has been reliable, no attendance issues.\nDOI 12/09/2025, Chloe was hit at an intersection driving the company vehicle at warehouse. First seen at Upstate Hearing & Balance Center on 12/12/2025, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. On modified duty from 12/10/2025. Alicia Romano is the worker\'s attorney. Still waiting on wage statement from the employer and initial medical report from Upstate Hearing & Balance Center.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 923, n.word_count = 158;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-015-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-015', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Rx check Dec 15: No early reffill issue', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 39, n.word_count = 8;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-016-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-016', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'FYI\nFrom: Alicia (front desk) <alicia@upstatehearingbalancecenter.example>\nSent: Mon, Dec 15, 2025 14:07\nTo: Daniel Brooks\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977160 - Nguyen\n\nHi Daniel,\nWe are requesting 6 PT visits, please advise.\nPlease confirm authorization for the office visit.\nOur billing for $152 was sent on December 12, please confirm receipt.\n\nThanks,\nAlicia (front desk)', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 366, n.word_count = 54;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-017-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-017', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Correction to my December 11 note - next appt w/ the Dr is 12/12, not 12/14.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 76, n.word_count = 16;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-018-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-018', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Compensability December 18: Disputing for now we need causation support C-7 sent to the Board.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 94, n.word_count = 15;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-019-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-019', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Statement from Chloe Nguyen: Chloe states she was hit at an intersection driving the company vehicle at warehouse around around noon. Denies prior problems with low back hip and both knees. Dominant hand is the left. Chloe said it was end of a long shift. Supervisor statement requested from Ravi Brandt. Asked Chloe if she had any trouble with low back hip and both knees before said no. Chloe drove home went to Upstate Hearing & Balance Center the next morning. Asked about any activities outside work nothing unusual.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 521, n.word_count = 89;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-020-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-020', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Chloe Nguyen called in re: Claim 6977160 Chloe confirmed DOI 12-9-2025 at warehouse Address and phone confirmed same as file.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 125, n.word_count = 20;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-021-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-021', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Susan spoke w/ pt. Reviewed restrictions: No lifting over 10 lbs, no repeated bending. Pt agreed to f/u appt 12/29. Pain 6/10 per pt.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 133, n.word_count = 24;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-022-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-022', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'From: Frank Nakamura <frank@cityoperationsdepartment.example>\nSent: Thu, Dec 25, 2025 13:30\nTo: Daniel Brooks\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977160 - Nguyen\n\nHi Daniel,\nChloe Nguyen has not returned our calls about the modified duty offer.\nPlease confirm whether the claim has been accepted.\nOur payroll shows Chloe Nguyen earned about $690 a week before the injury.\n\nThanks,\nFrank Nakamura', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 379, n.word_count = 57;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-023-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-023', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'bill review 12/26/25: xray from Upstate Hearing & Balance Center $89 reduced to fee schedule. -Jamal', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 100, n.word_count = 16;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-024-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-024', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'OFFICE NOTE 12/29/25 (Dr Haddad):\nSUBJECTIVE: pt c/o pain in the low back, worse by end of shift. pain 5/10. pt states compliant w/ tx.\nOBJECTIVE: guarded flexion, strength 5/5. lumbar xray no acute findings. ROM: lumbar flexion limited, extension ok.\nASSESSMENT: strain of the low back, hip and both knees, no change.\nPLAN: ice, heat, nsaids. restr: no lifting over 10 lbs, no repeated bending. work status: working modified duty. f/u 1/12.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 441, n.word_count = 73;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-025-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-025', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '12/31/25 Susan spoke w/ pt. Pt reports low back, hip and both knees sore and stiff. Barrier to RTW: Transportation. Will update Daniel. next appt 1/11.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 151, n.word_count = 26;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-026-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-026', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'January 5 auth: MG-2 rec\'d for low back, hip and both knees, reviewing. MRI auth\'d, Northeast Diagnostic Imaging to schedule. Waiting on the MRI report from Northeast Diagnostic Imaging.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 186, n.word_count = 29;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-027-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-027', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Correction to my December 31 note - next appt w/ the Dr is 1/12 not 1/11.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 73, n.word_count = 16;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-028-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-028', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Diary nothing new from employer or Upstate Hearing & Balance Center Reserves unchabged Waiting on the MRI report Will call Upstate Hearing & Balance Center if nothing by January 18.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 181, n.word_count = 30;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-029-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-029', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'FYI\nFrom: Kevin (front desk) <kevin@upstatehearingbalancecenter.example>\nSent: Wed, Jan 7, 2026 9:37\nTo: Daniel Brooks\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977160 - Nguyen\n\nHi Daniel,\nChloe Nguyen is being seen for strain of the low back, hip and both knees.\nOur billing for $223.00 was sent on December 29, please confirm receipt.\nAttached is the note from Chloe Nguyen\'s visit on December 29.\n\nRegards,\nKevin (front desk)', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 406, n.word_count = 65;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-030-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-030', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'File review January 9. Chloe has a strain of the low back, hip and both knees from December 9, claim is open, hearing coming up. Chloe is seeing Dr Haddad at Upstate Hearing & Balance Center and last reported pain at 5/10, low back, hip and both knees sore and stiff. Restr are: No lifting over 10 lbs, no repeated bending. Chloe is back on light duty. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Records from prior provider. Plan: We get the MRI report, then close the diary January 30.\nDOI December 9, Chloe was hit at an intersection driving the company vehicle at warehouse. First seen at Upstate Hearing & Balance Center on December 12, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. On modified duty from December 10. MRI ordered January 7, report still pending.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 803, n.word_count = 146;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-031-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-031', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'January 12 reserves - Daniel\'s file: ok to approve added PT', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 59, n.word_count = 11;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-032-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-032', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Upstate Hearing & Balance Center f/u Jan 12.\nSUBJECTIVE: pt c/o low back, hip and both knees sore and stiff. pain 4/10. pt states compliant w/ tx.\nOBJECTIVE: paraspinal spasm, FROM limited. lumbar xray no acute findings. ROM: lumbar flexion limited, extension ok.\nASSESSMENT: strain of the low back, hip and both knees, no change.\nPLAN: tylenol, activity modification. restr: no lifting over 10 lbs, no repeated bending. work status: working modified duty. f/u 2/2.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 465, n.word_count = 75;
