MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-099-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-099', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Spoke with front desk at Upstate Hearing & Balance Center, they will fax the note Asked Dr Haddad for an updated work status, fax request sent Upstate Hearing & Balance Center billing called about a denied visit, referred to SIF Upstate Hearing & Balance Center rec\'d our auth, visits scheduled Upstate Hearing & Balance Center says Chloe no showed the last appt Need the C-4.2 from Dr Haddad Dr Haddad wants Chloe to continue core stabilization, hamstring stretching, bridging Upstate Hearing & Balance Center sent a bill for $365.00, forwarded to bill review.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 561, n.word_count = 93;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-100-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-100', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Letter rec\'d July 31 from Alicia Romano (atty for Chloe Nguyen). Requesting copies of medical, wage statement and C-2F for claim 6977160.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 137, n.word_count = 22;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-101-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-101', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'File review August 4. Chloe has a strain of the low back hip and both knees from December 9 claim is scheduled for a hearing. Chloe is seeing Dr Haddad at Upstate Hearing and Balance Center and last reported pain at 0/10 mild stiffness only. Restr are: Released to full duty no restrictions. Chloe is back to full duty. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: We get the nothing then close the diary Aug 25.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 430, n.word_count = 80;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-102-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-102', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'bill review 8/7/26: PT visits from Upstate Hearing & Balance Center $447 paid.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 78, n.word_count = 13;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-103-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-103', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'August 11 sup review - Daniel: set reserve review for 30 days. refer to Susan for case mgmt. dont close until Board notice is rec\'d. call EE this week, hasnt been contacted since April 3. pull prior claim history again. need hearing prep done by 08/24/2026.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 257, n.word_count = 46;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-104-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-104', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Rec\'d this today, will call.\nFrom: Alicia Romano <alicia@romanolaw.example>\nSent: Thu, Aug 13, 2026 16:40\nTo: Daniel Brooks\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977160 - Nguyen\n\nHi Daniel,\nWe request authorization for the treatment recommended by Dr Haddad.\nPlease send the claim file, medical and wage records for my client Chloe Nguyen, claim 6977160.\nThe nothing is still outstanding on our end.\n\nThank you,\nAlicia Romano', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 407, n.word_count = 64;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-105-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-105', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'August 25 file check - nothing still outstanding Chloe Nguyen back to full duty Last med report April 3 Reserves unchanged.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 123, n.word_count = 21;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-106-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-106', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'ECase check - next hearing is on November 10, notice to employer and Alicia Romano. Claim 6977160, hearing before the judge. Copy to SIF and employer. Chloe asked if she has to attend - told to check the notice. Daniel aware. Nothing else scheduled that I can see. Chloe notified by letter. The IME report needs to be in by then.\nDOI 12/09/2025, Chloe was hit at an intersection driving the company vehicle at warehouse. First seen at Upstate Hearing & Balance Center on Dec 12, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. On modified duty from 12/10/2025. Back to full duty from February 18. MRI ordered January 7, result January 18: Mild disc bulge L4-5, no stenosis. IME with Dr Fischer on February 20, report March 10 says says tx is reasonable and ongoing. Alicia Romano is the worker\'s attorney. Hearing held February 20. Second hearing April 11. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $685 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Frank Nakamura, ER supervisor Ravi Brandt, treating Dr Haddad. Coverage: SIF on the risk, Rockland county, warehouse.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 1113, n.word_count = 191;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-107-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-107', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'LM for clmt 25AUG26. -Jamal', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 27, n.word_count = 5;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-108-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-108', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Subject: Status Report - Claim 6977160 - Chloe Nguyen\nHi Mei,\n\nPlease see the update below on Chloe Nguyen\'s claim (City Operations Department, DOI 12/09/2025, warehouse). I have kept the history short, call me if you want more.\n\nCLAIM HISTORY\nDOI December 9, Chloe Nguyen was hit at an intersection driving the company vehicle at warehouse. First seen at Upstate Hearing & Balance Center on December 12, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. On modified duty from December 10. Back to full duty from February 18. MRI ordered January 7, result January 18: mild disc bulge L4-5, no stenosis. IME with Dr Fischer on February 20, report March 10 says says treatment is reasonable and ongoing. Alicia Romano is the worker\'s attorney. Hearing held February 20. Second hearing April 11.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 820, n.word_count = 139;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-108-C02'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-108', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 2, n.text = 'CURRENT MEDICAL: treating with Dr Haddad at Upstate Hearing & Balance Center. Pain was 0/10 at the last visit (April 3) and Chloe reports no complaints. Restrictions: released to full duty, no restrictions.\nWORK STATUS: Chloe is working regular duty, no issues.\nBENEFITS: no lost time, no wage benefits due at this point. Medical bills are being paid per the fee schedule.\nLEGAL: next hearing is on November 10, notice to employer and Alicia Romano.\nIME: Dr Fischer saw Chloe and the report says says treatment is reasonable and ongoing. We are reviewing whether to dispute any of the ongoing treatment.\nChloe is represented by Alicia Romano, who has asked for the claim file and our position on added treatment. We are responding by letter.\nCONTACTS: adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Frank Nakamura (City Operations Department), ER supervisor Ravi Brandt, treating Dr Haddad at Upstate Hearing & Balance Center.\nCOVERAGE: SIF is on the risk. Claim is in Rockland county, injury location warehouse. No prior claims found on Chloe.\nOUTSTANDING: nothing.\nRESERVES: no change recommended right now, med reserve $8,500. We will revisit after the next medical report.\nPLAN: continue to monitor, speak with Chloe and employer again this month, and send the next update by September 14. Please let me know if you need anything else in the meantime.', n.char_start = 822, n.char_end = 2165, n.word_count = 220;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977160-108-C03'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977160-108', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 3, n.text = 'Thanks,\nDaniel Brooks', n.char_start = 2167, n.char_end = 2188, n.word_count = 3;
