MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977163-057-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977163-057', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Board notice rec\'d. Hearing held 2/2/26, adjourned for medical records. Claim 6977163, hearing before the judge. Copy to New Hampshire Insurance Co and the employer. Cx asked if she has to attend - told to check the notice. Olivia aware. Nothing else scheduled that I can see. The IME report needs to be in by then. Will monitor.\nDOI 5/1/15, cx has had noise exposure for years on the production floor at retail store. First seen at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center on 11/17/25, dx hearing loss of the ears, audiogram shows high-frequency loss.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 540, n.word_count = 94;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977163-058-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977163-058', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = '02/03/2026 Board notice rec\'d. Hearing held 2/2/26, adjourned for IME report. Claim 6977163, hearing before the judge. Copy to New Hampshire Insurance Co and the employer. Cx asked if she has to attend - told to check the notice. Olivia aware. Nothing else scheduled that I can see. Cx notified by letter. The IME report needs to be in by then.\nDOI 5/1/15, Mia has had noise exposure for years on the production floor at retail store. First seen at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center on 11/17/25, dx hearing loss of the ears, audiogram shows high-frequency loss. On modified duty from 11/13/25. Back to full duty from 12/11/25. IME with Dr Nakamura on 1/30/26, report pending. Lena Castillo is the worker\'s attorney. Hearing held 2/2/26. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $410 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Olivia Grant, ER contact Alicia Fischer, ER supervisor Carla Fischer, treating Dr Haddad. Coverage: New Hampshire Insurance Co on the risk, Allegany county, retail store. Still waiting on IME report.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 1014, n.word_count = 168;
