MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977163-060-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977163-060', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'IME update: Purpose: Causation + need for further tx for ears. IME report in: Finds partial disability, recommends more PT. Cx not happy with the exam, says it lasted 10 min. Dr Haddad may disagree. Need to decide if we dispute. Cx told to bring imaging and ID. IME fee $12,000.\nDOI 5/1/15, cx has had noise exposure for years on the production floor at retail store. First seen at Upstate Joint and Rehab Center on 11/17/25, dx hearing loss of the ears, audiogram shows high-frequency loss.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 491, n.word_count = 87;
