MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977175-059-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977175-059', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Victor Brandt called Feb 17 re: clmt. requesting copies of medical, wage statement and C-2F for claim 6977175. asks status of Board review. wants to know if State Insurance Fund will authorize more tx. said hearing may be needed if no response in 2 wks. sent request to State Insurance Fund records unit. demand for payment of xray, $261. RFA-1 filed for neck, back and wrists tx. we will respond by letter.\nDOI Nov 11, clmt was struck by coworker during a pallet move at facility parking area. first seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 11/14/2025, dx strain of the neck, back and wrists, lumbar xray no acute findings. Victor Brandt is worker\'s attorney. no wage payments, medical bills only, approx $575 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Maya Patel, ER contact Carla Iyer, ER supervisor Alicia Fischer, treating Dr Romano. Coverage: State Insurance Fund on the risk, Warren county, facility parking area.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 912, n.word_count = 153;
