MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977175-088-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977175-088', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'email from Victor Brandt\'s office. requesting copies of medical, wage statement and C-2F for claim 6977175. asks status of Board review. wants to know if State Insurance Fund will authorize more tx. said a hearing may be needed if no response in 2 wks. sent request to State Insurance Fund records unit. demand for payment of Rx, $173.50. RFA-1 filed for neck, back and wrists tx. we will respond by letter. Maya to respond.\nDOI Nov 11, clmt was struck by coworker during a pallet move at facility parking area. first seen at North Shore Occupational Health on Nov 14, dx strain of the neck, back and wrists, lumbar xray no acute findings. Victor Brandt is worker\'s attorney. no wage payments, medical bills only, approx $630 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Maya Patel, ER contact Carla Iyer, ER supervisor Alicia Fischer, treating Dr Romano. Coverage: State Insurance Fund on the risk, Warren county, facility parking area', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 924, n.word_count = 156;
