MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977178-053-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977178-053', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'File review 3/23/26. Julian has a contusion of the left hip/buttock from 12/16/25, claim is open, no Board date yet. Julian is seeing Dr Okafor at Brooklyn Occupational Medicine and last reported pain at 0/10, no complaints. Restrictions are: Released to full duty, no restrictions. Julian is back to full duty. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: Continue to monitor, next review 4/6/26.\nDOI 12/16/25, Julian slipped on ice in the lot and went down at service site. First seen at Brooklyn Occupational Medicine on 12/19/25, dx contusion of the left hip/buttock, xray neg for fracture. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $520 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Priya Shah, ER contact Joan Nakamura, ER supervisor Joan Brennan, treating Dr Okafor. Coverage: AMTRUST INSURANCE COMPANY on the risk, Richmond county, service site.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 861, n.word_count = 138;
