MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977178-055-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977178-055', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Outbound call to Julian. Wants a copy of the C-3, will mail. Asked about the status of the claim, explained it is open. Working regular duty, no issues. Said he slipped on ice in the lot and went down. Trouble sleeping because of the pain. Still hard to stand or walk for long. Julian Bell got a bill for $346.50 from Brooklyn Occupational Medicine, I told him not to pay it, we will check it. Asked him to call Joan Nakamura about the light duty at the company. Told to call with any changes.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 493, n.word_count = 94;
