MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977178-092-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977178-092', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'File review 8/5/26. Julian has a contusion of the left hip/buttock from 12/16/25, claim is open. Julian is seeing Dr Okafor at Brooklyn Occupational Medicine and last reported pain at 0/10, feeling much better, occasional soreness. Restrictions are: Released to full duty, no restrictions. Julian is back to full duty. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: We get the nothing, then close the diary 8/19/26.\nDOI 12/16/25, Julian slipped on ice in the lot and went down at service site. First seen at Brooklyn Occupational Medicine on 12/19/25, dx contusion of the left hip/buttock, xray neg for fracture. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $520 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Priya Shah, ER contact Joan Nakamura, ER supervisor Joan Brennan, treating Dr Okafor.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 797, n.word_count = 129;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977178-093-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977178-093', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'see below. -CJ\nFrom: Carol Jennings <carol@gbclaims.example>\nSent: Fri, Aug 7, 2026 7:24\nTo: Priya Shah\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977178 - Bell\n\nHi Priya,\nWe need the nothing before the next review.\nLet me know if you need authority for the PT visits.\nSend a status report to Amtrust Insurance Company by August 15.\n\nThank you,\nCarol Jennings', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 336, n.word_count = 58;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977178-094-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977178-094', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Closing note 8/14/26: Julian Bell back to full duty since 2/26/26, no f/u needed. Board closed the case, nothing open. No activity in 60 days, closing diary. Treated at Brooklyn Occupational Medicine, released, no restrictions. If Julian calls with a flare up, reopen and send back to Dr Okafor. All bills paid, nothing pending. Final med report rec\'d, contusion resolved. Total paid on the file approx $8,500.\nDOI 12/16/25, Julian slipped on ice in the lot and went down at service site. First seen at Brooklyn Occupational Medicine on 12/19/25, dx contusion of the left hip/buttock, xray neg for fracture.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 607, n.word_count = 100;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977178-095-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977178-095', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'FYI\nFrom: Rita (front desk) <rita@brooklynoccupationalmedicine.example>\nSent: Mon, Aug 17, 2026 8:11\nTo: Priya Shah\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977178 - Bell\n\nHi Priya,\nRestrictions reamin: released to full duty, no restrictions.\nWork status: working regular duty, no issues.\nWe are requesting 6 PT visits, please advise.\nPlease confirm authorization for the ortho connsult.\n\nRegards,\nRita (front desk)', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 394, n.word_count = 57;
