MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977194-063-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977194-063', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'File review January 21. Naomi has a strain of the right knee from June 29, claim is open. Naomi is seeing Dr Fischer at Capital Region Occupational Health and last reported pain at 4/10, pain at the front of the knee, catches. Restr are: No kneeling or squatting, limited stairs. Naomi is back to full duty. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: Continue to monitor, next review February 11.\nDOI June 29, Naomi got grabbed by another person during a transfer at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occupational Health on November 24, dx strain of the right knee, xray neg for fracture. PT at Summit Rehab & Sports PT started December 3, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,360 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Frank Kowalski, ER supervisor Dev Alvarez, treating Dr Fischer, PT Joan Haddad at Summit Rehab & Sports PT. Coverage: SIF on the risk, Warren county, warehouse.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 977, n.word_count = 169;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977194-064-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977194-064', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Capital Region Occupational Health f/u 01/21/2026.\nSUBJECTIVE: pt c/o knee sore, swelling after standing. pain 4/10. pt states compliant w/ tx.\nOBJECTIVE: mild effusion, gait guarded. xray neg for fracture. ROM: knee/ankle ROM near full, some pain at end range.\nASSESSMENT: strain of the right knee, no change.\nPLAN: PT, home exercise program. restr: no kneeling or squatting, limited stairs. work status: working regular duty, no issues. f/u 2/16.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 448, n.word_count = 69;
