MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977194-071-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977194-071', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'From: Frank Kowalski <frank@albanypublicworks.example>\nSent: Mon, Feb 16, 2026 14:16\nTo: Daniel Brooks\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977194 - Bailey\n\nHi Daniel,\nWe can offer light duty starting Feb 23, 4 hrs/day.\nPlease send us the restrictions in writing.\nIncident report was sent on November 22.\nOur insurer is SIF, adjuster is Daniel.\n\nThank you,\nFrank Kowalski', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 354, n.word_count = 56;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977194-072-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977194-072', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'File review February 19. Naomi has a strain of the right knee from June 29, claim is open. Naomi is seeing Dr Fischer at Capital Region Occupational Health and last reported pain at 4/10, knee sore, swelling after standing. Restr are: No kneeling, otherwise ok for full shift. Naomi is back to full duty. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: We get the nothing, then close the diary March 5.\nDOI June 29, Naomi got grabbed by another person during a transfer at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occupational Health on Nov 24, dx strain of the right knee, xray neg for fracture. PT at Summit Rehab & Sports PT started December 3, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,415 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Frank Kowalski, ER supervisor Dev Alvarez, treating Dr Fischer, PT Joan Haddad at Summit Rehab & Sports PT. Coverage: SIF on the risk, Warren county, warehouse.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 973, n.word_count = 170;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977194-073-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977194-073', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'March 13 reserves - Daniel\'s file: increased med reserve because hearing scheduled Daniel requested more authority we should revisit after next medical', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 151, n.word_count = 22;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977194-074-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977194-074', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'File review March 25. Naomi has a stran of the right knee from June 29, claim is open. Naomi is seeing Dr Fischer at Capital Region Occupational Health and last reported pain at 0/10, feeling much better, occasional soreness. Restr are: Released to full duty, no restr. Naomi is working regular duty, no issues. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: Call Naomi, follow up with Dr Fischer, review again 04/08/2026.\nDOI June 29, Naomi got grabbed by another person during a transfer at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occupational Health on 11-24-2025, dx strain of the right knee, xray neg for fracture. PT at Summit Rehab & Sports PT started 12-3-2025, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,415 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Frank Kowalski, ER supervisor Dev Alvarez, treating Dr Fischer, PT Joan Haddad at Summit Rehab & Sports PT. Coverage: State Ins Fund on the risk, Warren county, warehouse.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 1008, n.word_count = 170;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977194-075-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977194-075', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'sup review - Daniel: call EE this week, hasnt been contactde since 2/16/26.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 75, n.word_count = 13;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977194-076-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977194-076', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Subject: Status Report - Claim 6977194 - Naomi Bailey\nHi Ravi,\n\nPlease see the update below on Naomi Bailey\'s claim (Albany Public Works, DOI June 29, warehouse). I have kept the history short, call me if you want more.\n\nCLAIM HISTORY\nDOI June 29, Naomi Bailey got grabbed by another person during a transfer at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occupational Health on November 24, dx strain of the right knee, xray neg for fracture. PT at Summit Rehab & Sports PT started December 3, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,415 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Frank Kowalski, ER supervisor Dev Alvarez, treating Dr Fischer, PT Joan Haddad at Summit Rehab & Sports PT. Coverage: SIF on the risk, Warren county, warehouse.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 802, n.word_count = 137;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977194-076-C02'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977194-076', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 2, n.text = 'CURRENT MEDICAL: treating with Dr Fischer at Capital Region Occupational Health. Pain was 0/10 at the last visit (February 16) and Naomi reports feeling much better, occasional soreness. Restrictions: released to full duty, no restrictions.\nWORK STATUS: Naomi is back to full duty.\nBENEFITS: no lost time, no wage benefits due at this point. Medical bills are being paid per the fee schedule.\nLEGAL: no hearings or conciliation set, nothing from the Board that needs a response.\nCONTACTS: adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Frank Kowalski (Albany Public Works), ER supervisor Dev Alvarez, treating Dr Fischer at Capital Region Occupational Health. PT is Joan Haddad at Summit Rehab & Sports PT.\nCOVERAGE: SIF is on the risk. Claim is in Warren county, injury location warehouse. No prior claims found on Naomi.\nOUTSTANDING: nothing.\nRESERVES: no change recommended right now, med reserve $12,000. We will revisit after the next medical report.\nPLAN: continue to monitor, speak with Naomi and employer again this month, and send the next update by 4/27/26. Please let me know if you need anything else in the meantime.\n\nThanks,\nDaniel Brooks', n.char_start = 804, n.char_end = 1944, n.word_count = 183;
MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977194-077-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977194-077', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'Diary - no change Naomi Bailey working', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 38, n.word_count = 7;
