MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: 'SYN-6977197-066-C01'}) SET n.parent_id = 'SYN-6977197-066', n.parent_kind = 'Note', n.position = 1, n.text = 'STATUS: cx, left knee strain, DOI 12/15/25. file is still open.\nMEDICAL: seeing Dr Lindqvist at Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab; pain 6/10 per last note; knee sore, swelling after standing.\nWORK: back to full duty; restr: no kneeling or squatting, limited stairs.\nPAY: no lost time, no wage payments, medical biols only.\nLEGAL: hearing held Feb 24, adjourned for IME report.\nPENDING: IME report.\nPLAN: we get the IME report, then close the diary 4/8/26.\nHISTORY: DOI 12/15/25, cx slipped on a spill near the counter at retail store. First seen at Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab on 12/18/25, dx strain of the left knee, xray neg for fracture. On modified duty from 12/17/25. Back to full duty from 3/6/26. PT at Summit Rehab & Sports PT started 12/31/25, 16 of 16 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered 1/6/26, result 1/18/26: mild effusion, possible meniscus signal change. IME with Dr Doyle on 3/9/26, report pending. Carla Brennan is the worker\'s attorney. Hearing held 2/24/26. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,695 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Olivia Grant, ER contact Dev Sato, ER supervisor Lena Haddad, treating Dr Lindqvist, PT Carla Castillo at Summit Rehab & Sports PT. Coverage: Starbucks Corporation on the risk, Nassau county, retail store. Still waiting on IME report.', n.char_start = 0, n.char_end = 1297, n.word_count = 216;
