 the next medical report.\nPLAN: continue to monitor, speak with cx and the employer again this month, and send the next update by 7/24/26. Please let me know if you need anything else in the meantime.\n\nThanks,\nOlivia Grant', n.word_count = 324, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977100-100'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977100', n.note_date = '2026-07-01', n.note_type = 'File Review', n.author_name = 'Olivia Grant', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'STATUS: cx, right hand hand injury, DOI 11/21/25. file is open, no Board date yet.\nMEDICAL: seeing Dr Osei at Brooklyn Occupational Medicine; pain 0/10 per last note; no complaints.\nWORK: working regular duty, no issues; restr: released to full duty, no restrictions.\nPAY: no lost time, no wage payments, medical bills only.\nLEGAL: conciliation held 1-9-2026, issue narrowed to wage rate.\nPENDING: nothing.\nPLAN: we get the nothing, then close the diary 7/31/26.\nHISTORY: DOI 11/21/25, cx tripped on something on the floor and went down at service site. First seen at Brooklyn Occupational Medicine on 11/25/25, dx hand injury of the right hand, xray neg. On modified duty from 11/24/25. Back to full duty from 2/10/26.', n.word_count = 118, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
