MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977118-081'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977118', n.note_date = '2026-05-26', n.note_type = 'Worker Message', n.author_name = 'Tina Morales', n.author_role = 'assistant', n.text = 'need to respond to this. -Tina\nFrom: Nina Foster <nina@mail.example>\nSent: Tue, May 26, 2026 14:38\nTo: Elena Cruz\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977118 - Foster\n\nhi,\ni went to Upstate Joint & Rehab Center on 03/13/2026.\nmy low back and both shoulders is still bothering me, about 0 out of 10.\nplease call me back, my number is the same.\nplease let me know when my next check is coming.\n\nthanks\nNina', n.word_count = 72, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = true, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977118-082'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977118', n.note_date = '2026-05-27', n.note_type = 'Status Report', n.author_name = 'Elena Cruz', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Subject: Status Report - Claim 6977118 - Nina Foster\nHi Beth,\n\nPlease see the update below on Nina Foster\'s claim (Orange Supply Cooperative, DOI Dec 27, office stairwell). I have kept the history short, call me if you want more.\n\nCLAIM HISTORY\nDOI Dec 27, Nina Foster got the low back and both shoulders caught between a pallet and a rack handling stock at office stairwell. First seen at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center on Jan 1, dx sprain of the low back and both shoulders, lumbar xray no acute findings. PT at Lakeview Physical Therapy started 1/12/26, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered Jan 19, result Jan 29: mild disc bulge L4-5, no stenosis. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,415 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Elena Cruz, ER contact Lena Brandt, ER supervisor Greg Sato, treating Dr Whitaker, PT Lena Castillo at Lakeview Physical Therapy. Coverage: Police on the risk, Kings county, office stairwell.\n\nCURRENT MEDICAL: treating with Dr Whitaker at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center. Pain was 0/10 at the last visit (Mar 13) and Nina reports feeling much better, occasional soreness. Restrictions: released to full duty, no restrictions.\nWORK STATUS: Nina is back to full duty.\nBENEFITS: no lost time, no wage benefits due at this point. Medical bills are being paid per the fee schedule.\nLEGAL: no hearings or conciliation set, nothing from the Board that needs a response.\nCONTACTS: adjuster Elena Cruz, ER contact Lena Brandt (Orange Supply Cooperative), ER supervisor Greg Sato, treating Dr Whitaker at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center. PT is Lena Castillo at Lakeview Physical Therapy.\nCOVERAGE: Police is on the risk. Claim is in Kings county, injury location office stairwell. No prior claims found on Nina.\nOUTSTANDING: nothing.\nRESERVES: no change recommended right now, med reserve $6,000. We will revisit after the next medical report.\nPLAN: continue to monitor, speak with Nina and the company again this month, and send the next update by 06/10/2026. Please let me know if you need anything else in the meantime.\n\nThanks,\nElena Cruz', n.word_count = 346, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977118-083'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977118', n.note_date = '2026-05-27', n.note_type = 'File Review', n.author_name = 'Elena Cruz', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'File review 05/27/2026. Nina has a sprain of the low back and both shoulders from Dec 27, claim is open, no Board date yet. Nina is seeing Dr Whitaker at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center and last reported pain at 0/10, mild stiffness only. Restrictions are: Released to full duty, no restrictions. Nina is working regular duty, no issues. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: We get the nothing, then close the diary 6/10/26.\nDOI Dec 27, Nina got the low back and both shoulders caught between a pallet and a rack handling stock at office stairwell. First seen at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center on Jan 1, dx sprain of the low back and both shoulders, lumbar xray no acute findings. PT at Lakeview PT started Jan 12, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered 01/19/2026, result Jan 29: Mild disc bulge L4-5, no stenosis. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,415 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Elena Cruz, ER contact Lena Brandt, ER supervisor Greg Sato, treating Dr Whitaker, PT Lena Castillo at Lakeview PT. Coverage: POLICE on the risk, Kings county, office stairwell.', n.word_count = 195, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
