MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-031'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-01-13', n.note_type = 'Contact - Injured Worker', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Outbound call to Leo. Leo Morgan states neck, upper back and shoulder sore and stiff. Asked who pays for Capital Region Occupational Health visits, told Hartford Casualty Insurance Co pays per fee schedule and to keep receipts. Said he was repositioning stock and felt a pull. Still hard to reach overhead or lift. Address and phone confirmed same as file. Asked if Daniel is still the adjuster, confirmed. Advised to keep appts.\nDOI December 19, Leo was repositioning stock and felt a pull at warehouse.', n.word_count = 85, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-032'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-01-14', n.note_type = 'Contact - Provider', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'January 14 - Capital Region Occupational Health called. Dr Lindqvist\'s office says next appt 1/26.', n.word_count = 15, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-033'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-01-16', n.note_type = 'Pharmacy', n.author_name = 'Pam Whitfield', n.author_role = 'specialist', n.text = '16JAN26 pharmacy note (Harbor Drug): Leo paid out of pocket $62.00, asked for reimbursement.', n.word_count = 14, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-034'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-01-26', n.note_type = 'File Review', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'File review January 26. Leo has a strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder from December 19, claim is open, no Board date yet. Leo is seeing Dr Lindqvist at Capital Region Occ Health and last reported pain at 4/10, pain in the neck, worse by end of shift. Restr are: No overhead work, lifting to 15 lbs. Leo is back to full duty. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Records from prior provider. Plan: Continue to monitor, next review February 16.\nDOI December 19, Leo was repositioning stock and felt a pull at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occupational Health on December 24, dx strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder, xray neg. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $465 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Victor Alvarez, ER supervisor Alicia Whitaker, treating Dr Lindqvist.', n.word_count = 146, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-035'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-01-26', n.note_type = 'Medical Update', n.author_name = 'Dr Lindqvist', n.author_role = 'treating provider', n.text = 'OFFICE NOTE January 26 (Dr Lindqvist): Restr: No overhead work, lifting to 15 lbs.', n.word_count = 14, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-036'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-01-26', n.note_type = 'Reserve Review', n.author_name = 'Carol Jennings', n.author_role = 'supervisor', n.text = 'January 26 reserves - Daniel\'s file: med reserve $22,000. reserves unchanged. increased med reserve bc hearing scheduled. Daniel requested more authority. ok to send status report. paid to date approx $15,000. we should revisit after next medical.\nDOI December 19, EE was repositioning stock and felt a pull at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occ Health on December 24, dx strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder, xray neg. no wage payments, medical bills only, approx $465 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Victor Alvarez, ER supervisor Alicia Whitaker, treating Dr Lindqvist. Coverage: Hartford Casualty Insurance Co on the risk, Queens county, warehouse. still waiting on records from prior provider. -CJ', n.word_count = 116, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-037'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-01-26', n.note_type = 'Contact - Employer', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Need to respond to this.\nFrom: Victor Alvarez <victor@lakesidecoffeeretail.example>\nSent: Mon, Jan 26, 2026 7:27\nTo: Daniel Brooks\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977121 - Morgan\n\nHi Daniel,\nAttached is the wage statement for Leo Morgan.\nPlease confirm whether the claim has been accepted.\nOur insurer is Hartford Casualty Insurance Co, adjuster is Daniel.\n\nThank you,\nVictor Alvarez', n.word_count = 56, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = true, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-038'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-01-29', n.note_type = 'Diary Entry', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Checked eCase, nothing new. Will call Capital Region Occupational Health if nothing by February 4.', n.word_count = 15, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-039'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-02-03', n.note_type = 'Diary Entry', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Diary February 3: Nothing new from employer or Capital Region Occupational Health Leo Morgan back to full duty No concerns re: Compliance.', n.word_count = 22, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-040'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-02-03', n.note_type = 'Contact - Injured Worker', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Called Leo Morgan, reached on 2nd try.', n.word_count = 7, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-041'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-02-03', n.note_type = 'Work Status', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'RTW: Restr per Dr Lindqvist: No overhead work, lifting to 15 lbs. Employer should have the new restr in writing.', n.word_count = 20, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-042'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-02-04', n.note_type = 'Work Status', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'February 4 - RTW: Full duty release exepcted 2/9.', n.word_count = 9, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-043'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-02-04', n.note_type = 'Contact - Employer', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Email from Victor Alvarez February 4. Leo Morgan is on sick time. Employer wants to know if the claim is accepted, told them it is still open. Asked Victor Alvarez about restr: No overhead work, lifting to 15 lbs. Employer concerned about overtime coverage. Employer says Leo missed 3 days last month. Told Victor Alvarez we cant discuss reserves.\nDOI December 19, Leo was repositioning stock and felt a pull at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occupational Health on December 24, dx strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder, xray neg.', n.word_count = 93, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-044'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-02-09', n.note_type = 'Contact - Injured Worker', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Spoke with Leo Morgan February 9. Worried about employer cutting hours.', n.word_count = 11, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-045'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-02-10', n.note_type = 'Status Report', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Subject: Status Report - Claim 6977121 - Leo Morgan\nHi Dana,\n\nPlease see the update below on Leo Morgan\'s claim (Lakeside Coffee Retail, DOI 12-19-2025, warehouse). I have kept the history short, call me if you want more.\n\nCLAIM HISTORY\nDOI December 19, Leo Morgan was repositioning stock and felt a pull at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occupational Health on December 24, dx strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder, xray neg. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $520 paid to date. Contacts: adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Victor Alvarez, ER supervisor Alicia Whitaker, treating Dr Lindqvist. Coverage: HARTFORD CASUALTY INSURANCE CO on the risk, Queens county, warehouse.\n\nCURRENT MEDICAL: treating with Dr Lindqvist at Capital Region Occupational Health. Pain was 3/10 at the last visit (09FEB26) and Leo reports pain in the neck, worse by end of shift. Restrictions: no overhead work, lifting to 15 lbs.\nWORK STATUS: Leo is back to full duty.\nBENEFITS: no lost time, no wage benefits due at this point. Medical bills are being paid per the fee schedule.\nLEGAL: no hearings or conciliation set, nothing from the Board that needs a response.\nCONTACTS: adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Victor Alvarez (Lakeside Coffee Retail), ER supervisor Alicia Whitaker, treating Dr Lindqvist at Capital Region Occupational Health.\nCOVERAGE: HARTFORD CASUALTY INSURANCE CO is on the risk. Claim is in Queens county, injury location warehouse. No prior claims found on Leo.\nOUTSTANDING: nothing.\nRESERVES: no change recommended right now, med reserve $8,500. We will revisit after the next medical report.\nPLAN: continue to monitor, speak with Leo and employer again this month, and send the next update by 2-24-2026. Please let me know if you need anything else in the meantime.\n\nThanks,\nDaniel Brooks', n.word_count = 292, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-046'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-02-11', n.note_type = 'Medical Update', n.author_name = 'Dr Lindqvist', n.author_role = 'treating provider', n.text = 'OFFICE NOTE 02/11/2026 (Dr Lindqvist):\nSUBJECTIVE: pt c/o pain in the neck, worse by end of shift. pain 3/10. pt states compliant w/ tx.\nOBJECTIVE: TTP, ROM limited overhead. xray neg. ROM: ROM improving, still guarded overhead.\nASSESSMENT: strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder, improving.\nPLAN: ice, heat, nsaids. restr: no overhead work, lifting to 15 lbs. work status: back to full duty. f/u 3/9.', n.word_count = 67, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
