MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977121-086'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977121', n.note_date = '2026-07-06', n.note_type = 'File Review', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'File review Jul 6. Leo has a strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder from December 19, claim is still open. Leo is seeing Dr Lindqvist at Capital Region Occupational Health and last reported pain at 0/10, mild stiffness only. Restr are: Released to full duty, no restr. Leo is working regular duty, no issues. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: We get the nothing, then close the diary July 20.\nDOI 12-19-2025, Leo was repositioning stock and felt a pull at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occupational Health on December 24, dx strain of the neck, upper back and shoulder, xray neg. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $630 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Victor Alvarez, ER supervisor Alicia Whitaker, treating Dr Lindqvist. Coverage: Hartford Casualty Insurance Co on the risk, Queens county, warehouse.', n.word_count = 147, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
