MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977144-094'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977144', n.note_date = '2026-07-20', n.note_type = 'File Review', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'File review July 20. Priya has a contusion of the neck and low back from December 26, claim is open. Priya is seeing Dr Okafor at Empire Physical Medicine and last reported pain at 0/10, feeling much better, occasional soreness. Restr are: Released to full duty, no restr. Priya is back to full duty. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: Call Priya, follow up with Dr Okafor, review again August 19.\nDOI 26DEC25, Priya tripped on something on the floor and went down at service site. First seen at Empire Physical Medicine on 12-30-2025, dx contusion of the neck and low back, lumbar xray no acute findings. On modified duty from December 29. Back to full duty from February 22. PT at Riverbend Physical Therapy started January 12, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered January 26, result February 7: Mild disc bulge L4-5, no stenosis. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,415 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Paula Nakamura, ER supervisor Tasha Okafor, treating Dr Okafor, PT Victor Haddad at Riverbend Physical Therapy. Coverage: Wegmans Food Markets on the risk, Monroe county, service site.', n.word_count = 198, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977144-095'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977144', n.note_date = '2026-07-20', n.note_type = 'Reserve Review', n.author_name = 'Carol Jennings', n.author_role = 'supervisor', n.text = 'reserve review July 20: increased med reserve bc hearing scheduled Daniel requested more authority -CJ', n.word_count = 15, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977144-096'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977144', n.note_date = '2026-08-21', n.note_type = 'File Review', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'File review August 21. Priya has a contusion of the neck and low back from December 26, claim is open, no Board date yet. Priya is seeing Dr Okafor at Empire Physical Medicine and last reported pain at 0/10, feeing much better, occasional soreness. Restr are: Released to full duty, no restr. Priya is back to full duty. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: Continue to monitor, next review September 20.\nDOI December 26, Priya tripped on something on the floor and went down at service site. First seen at Empire Physical Medicine on December 30, dx contusion of the neck and low back, lumbar xray no acute finidngs. On modified duty from 29DEC25. Back to full duty from February 22.', n.word_count = 126, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977144-097'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977144', n.note_date = '2026-09-07', n.note_type = 'Closure / Reopen', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Closing review: Priya back to full duty since March 18, no f/u needed. Board closed the case, nothing open. No activity in 60 days, closing diary. Treated at Empire Physical Medicine, released, no restr. If Priya calls with a flare up, reopen and send back to Dr Okafor. All bills paid, nothing pending. Final med report rec\'d, contusion resolved. Total paid on the file approx $4,500.\nDOI December 26, Priya tripped on something on the floor and went down at service site. First seen at Empire Physical Medicine on December 30, dx contusion of the neck and low back, lumbar xray no acute findings. On modified duty from December 29. Back to full duty from February 22. PT at Riverbend Physical Therapy started January 12, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. MRI ordered January 26, result February 7: Mild disc bulge L4-5, no stenosis. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,415 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Paula Nakamura, ER supervisor Tasha Okafor, treating Dr Okafor, PT Victor Haddad at Riverbend Physical Therapy. Coverage: Wegmans Food Markets on the risk, Monroe county, service site.', n.word_count = 190, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-004'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-22', n.note_type = 'Prior Claims Check', n.author_name = 'Tina Morales', n.author_role = 'assistant', n.text = 'ran prior claims for Emma Rivera, none found. -Tina', n.word_count = 9, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-005'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-22', n.note_type = 'First Report Summary', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'New assignment , DOI 12/21/2025 at operations facility. IW says she missed last few steps and fell at operations facility. sx: pain in the low back, worse by end of shift. treating at North Shore Occupational Health w/ DR Haddad. employer sent C-2F, rec\'d 12/25/2025. dx per first visit: strain. C-3 not yet rec\'d. will call IW and employer today. we have not rec\'d any wage info yet. employer says IW has worked there a while, no prior injuries per Tasha Kowalski. coverage confirmed, State Insurance Fund is on risk. we need job description and wage statement from employer. claim # 6977156, Queens county.\nDOI 12/21/2025, IW missed the last few steps and fell at operations facility. Off work from 12/22/25. Lena Alvarez is the worker\'s attorney', n.word_count = 127, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-006'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-23', n.note_type = 'Contact - Employer', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'per email, will f/u\nFrom: Tasha Kowalski <tasha@harborviewcommunityhealth.example>\nSent: Tue, Dec 23, 2025 17:22\nTo: Marcus Hill\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977156 - Rivera\n\nHi Marcus,\nWe can offer light duty starting 01/03/2026, 4 hrs/day.\nPlease confirm whether the clami has been accepted.\nPlease send us the restrictions in writing.\n\nRegards,\nTasha Kowalski', n.word_count = 52, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = true, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-007'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-23', n.note_type = 'Contact - Injured Worker', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 's/w IW . IW states low back hip and both knees sore and stiff -MH', n.word_count = 15, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-008'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-24', n.note_type = 'Contact - Provider', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = '12/24/2025 - DR HADDAD\'S OFFICE. DR HADDAD WANTS IW TO CONTINUE CORE STABILIZATION, HAMSTRING STRETCHING, BRIDGING. -MH', n.word_count = 17, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-009'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-25', n.note_type = 'Work Status', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = '12/25/2025 - RTW: IW is still off work -MH', n.word_count = 9, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-010'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-26', n.note_type = 'Medical Update', n.author_name = 'Dr Haddad', n.author_role = 'treating provider', n.text = 'North Shore Occ Health f/u 12/26/25.\nSUBJECTIVE: pt c/o low back, hip and both knees sore and stiff. pain 6/10.\nOBJECTIVE: paraspinal spasm, FROM limited. lumbar xray no acute findings. ROM: lumbar flexion limited, extension ok.\nASSESSMENT: strain of the low back, hip and both knees, no change.\nPLAN: ice, heat, nsaids. restr: no lifting over 10 lbs, no repeated bending. work status: still off work. f/u 1/12.', n.word_count = 68, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-011'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-26', n.note_type = 'Imaging Result', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'rec\'d this today, will call. -MH\nFrom: Greg (front desk) <greg@northshoreoccupationalhealth.example>\nSent: Fri, Dec 26, 2025 16:51\nTo: Marcus Hill\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977156 - Rivera\n\nHi Marcus,\nEmma Rivera is being seen for strain of the low back, hip and both knees.\nWork status: remains off work per the Dr.\nWe are requesting 6 PT visits, please advise.\n\nThanks,\nGreg (front desk)', n.word_count = 63, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = true, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-012'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-29', n.note_type = 'Supervisor Incident Statement', n.author_name = 'Greg Romano', n.author_role = 'ER supervisor', n.text = 'SUP STMT 12/29/25 - Greg Romano. I was on shift 12/21/25. Emma Rivera told me she missed the last few steps and fell. Location was operations facility. Emma finished the shift but was favoring it. I offered to call an ambulance, she said no. The floor was dry that day as far as i know. Signed Greg Romano\nDOI 12/21/25, Emma missed the last few steps and fell at operations facility. First seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 12/25/25, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings.', n.word_count = 95, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-013'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-29', n.note_type = 'Statement / Investigation', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'recorded statement IW 12/29/2025: IW states she missed last few steps and fell at operations facility around 8:30am. no one saw it, a coworker came over after. she reported to Greg Romano right away, told to see North Shore Occupational Health. denies prior problems w/ low back, hip and both knees. dominant hand is the right. asked IW if she had any trouble with low back, hip and both knees before, said no. IW has been w/ employer a few years, regular schedule. IW says she told Greg Romano before end of shift. IW says nobody has offered light duty yet. asked about any activities outside work, nothing unusual.\nDOI 12/21/2025, IW missed the last few steps and fell at operations facility. first seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 12/25/2025, dx strain of low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. Off work from 12/22/2025. Lena Alvarez is the worker\'s attorney. still waiting on wage statement from employer and initial medical report from North Shore Occupational Health.', n.word_count = 171, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-014'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-30', n.note_type = 'Contact - Injured Worker', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'S/W IW . ASKED IF MARCUS IS STILL THE ADJUSTER, CONFIRMED. -MH', n.word_count = 12, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-015'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-30', n.note_type = 'Contact - Injured Worker', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = '12/30/2025 - s/w IW by phone. IW confirmed DOI 12/21/2025 at operations facility. said she missed the last few steps and fell. asked about mileage reimbursement, told to send C-257 w/ receipts. asked when the next check is due, told IW checks are $710.00/wk. address and phone confirmed same as file. Emma got a bill for $410 from North Shore Occupational Health, I told her not to pay it, we will check it.\nDOI 12/21/2025, IW missed last few steps and fell at operations facility. -MH', n.word_count = 86, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-016'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-30', n.note_type = 'Worker Message', n.author_name = 'Tina Morales', n.author_role = 'assistant', n.text = 'VM from Emma: nobody called me back abojt initial medical report from North Shore Occupational Health. when is my next payment. i sent forms last week did you get them. my number changed, new one is on file now. tylenol is not really helping. do i need to go to IME, i dont have a ride. thx -Tina', n.word_count = 58, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-017'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2025-12-31', n.note_type = 'Benefits Payment', n.author_name = 'Pam Whitfield', n.author_role = 'specialist', n.text = '12/31/2025 pmt note (Marcus): Clmt called abouut a late check, $436.75 outstanding. Direct deposit set up for clmt.', n.word_count = 18, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-018'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2026-01-02', n.note_type = 'Contact - Provider', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = '01/02/2026 called North Shore Occupational Health for records, 5-7 business days. asked DR Haddad for an updated work status, fax request sent. North Shore Occupational Health billing called about denied visit, referred to State Ins Fund. North Shore Occupational Health says IW no showed the last appt. records rec\'d from North Shore Occupational Health, 10 pages. need C-4.2 from DR Haddad. DR Haddad wants IW to continue core stabilization, hamstring stretching, bridging. North Shore Occupational Health sent bill for $175.75, forwarded to bill review. -MH', n.word_count = 85, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-019'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2026-01-05', n.note_type = 'Compensability Review', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'compensability 01/05/2026: disputing for now, we need causation support, C-7 sent to the Board. lost time over 7 days, wage benefits due. will revisit once medical comes in. IW\'s account is consistent w/ DR Haddad\'s first note. we will diary for the wage statement. no signs of prior injury in the records so far.\nDOI 12/21/2025, IW missed last few steps and fell at operations facility. first seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 12/25/2025, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings. -MH', n.word_count = 91, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-020'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2026-01-05', n.note_type = 'Nurse Case Manager Note', n.author_name = 'Susan Park RN', n.author_role = 'nurse', n.text = 'Case mgr note (Susan): Pt reports low back, hip and both knees sore and stiff. Reviewed restrictions: No lifting over 10 lbs, no repeated bending. Barrier to RTW: Pain w/ driving. Pt agreed to f/u appt 1/12. Med adherence ok (tylenol). ER contact: Tasha Kowalski. Pain 6/10 per pt. Pt attended 1 of 6 PT visits so far.\nDOI 12/21/25, Emma Rivera missed the last few steps and fell at operations facility. First seen at North Shore Occupational Health on 12/25/25, dx strain of the low back, hip and both knees, lumbar xray no acute findings.', n.word_count = 96, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-021'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2026-01-06', n.note_type = 'Diary Entry', n.author_name = 'Marcus Hill', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = '01/06/2026 NO ACTIVITY DIARY +30. WILL CALL NORTH SHORE OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH IF NOTHING BY 01/15/2026. -MH', n.word_count = 16, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977156-022'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977156', n.note_date = '2026-01-06', n.note_type = 'Therapy Update', n.author_name = 'Lena Mehta', n.author_role = 'physical therapist', n.text = 'PT visit 1/6 January 6 (Summit Rehab & Sports PT) Did core stabilization, hamstring stretching, bridging +', n.word_count = 17, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
