n Rockland county, injury location warehouse. No prior claims found on Chloe.\nOUTSTANDING: nothing.\nRESERVES: no change recommended right now, med reserve $4,500. We will revisit after the next medical report.\nPLAN: continue to monitor, speak with Chloe and employer again this month, and send the next update by August 8. Please let me know if you need anything else in the meantime.\n\nThanks,\nDaniel Brooks', n.word_count = 364, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
