MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977163-067'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977163', n.note_date = '2026-02-24', n.note_type = 'Contact - Injured Worker', n.author_name = 'Olivia Grant', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = '2/24/26 outbound call to Mia. Pain about 0/10 today per cx. Worried about the employer cutting hours. Taking OTC pain relievers as needed. Said she has had noise exposure for years on the production floor. Asked if Olivia is still the adjuster, confirmed. Cx says Lena Castillo will call me. Next appt with Dr Haddad is prn. Cx got a bill for $480 from Upstate Joint & Rehab Center, I told her not to pay it, we will check it. Asked her to call Alicia Fischer about the light duty at the employer. Advised to keep appts.\nDOI 5/1/15, cx has had noise exposure for years on the production floor at retail store. First seen at Upstate Joint & Rehab Center on 11/17/25, dx hearing loss of the ears, audiogram shows high-frequency loss. On modified duty from 11/13/25. Back to full duty from 12/11/25. IME with Dr Nakamura on 1/30/26, report Feb 12 says finds partial disability, recommends more PT. Lena Castillo is the worker\'s attorney. Hearing held 2/2/26. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $410 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Olivia Grant, ER contact Alicia Fischer, ER supervisor Carla Fischer, treating Dr Haddad. Coverage: New Hampshire Insurance Co on the risk, Allegany county, retail store.', n.word_count = 207, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
