MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977178-063'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977178', n.note_date = '2026-03-31', n.note_type = 'Contact - Employer', n.author_name = 'Priya Shah', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'From: Joan Nakamura <joan@empirelogistics.example>\nSent: Tue, Mar 31, 2026 16:39\nTo: Priya Shah\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977178 - Bell\n\nHi Priya,\nIncident report was sent on 12/18/25.\nWe can offer light duty satrting 4/5/26, 4 hrs/day.\nOur payroll shows Julian Bell earned about $890 a week before the injury.\nJob description attached.\n\nRegards,\nJoan Nakamura', n.word_count = 55, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = true, n.looks_truncated = false;
