MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977178-093'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977178', n.note_date = '2026-08-07', n.note_type = 'Supervisor Direction', n.author_name = 'Carol Jennings', n.author_role = 'supervisor', n.text = 'see below. -CJ\nFrom: Carol Jennings <carol@gbclaims.example>\nSent: Fri, Aug 7, 2026 7:24\nTo: Priya Shah\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977178 - Bell\n\nHi Priya,\nWe need the nothing before the next review.\nLet me know if you need authority for the PT visits.\nSend a status report to Amtrust Insurance Company by August 15.\n\nThank you,\nCarol Jennings', n.word_count = 58, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = true, n.looks_truncated = false;
