MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977194-095'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977194', n.note_date = '2026-08-11', n.note_type = 'File Review', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'File review August 11. Naomi has a strain of the right knee from June 29, claim is open, no Board date yet. Naomi is seeing Dr Fischer at Capital Region Occupational Health and last reported pain at 0/10, mild stiffness only. Restr are: Released to full duty, no restr. Naomi is working regular duty, no issues. No lost time and no wage payments due. Pending: Nothing. Plan: Call Naomi, follow up with Dr Fischer, review again 08/25/2026.\nDOI June 29, Naomi got grabbed by another person during a transfer at warehouse. First seen at Capital Region Occupational Health on November 24, dx strain of the right knee, xray neg for fracture. PT at Summit Rehab & Sports PT started December 3, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far. No wage payments, medical bills only, approx $1,415 paid to date. Contacts: Adjuster Daniel Brooks, ER contact Frank Kowalski, ER supervisor Dev Alvarez, treating Dr Fischer, PT Joan Haddad at Summit Rehab & Sports PT. Coverage: State Insurance Fund on the risk, Warren county, warehouse.', n.word_count = 174, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977194-096'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977194', n.note_date = '2026-08-17', n.note_type = 'Reserve Review', n.author_name = 'Ray Delgado', n.author_role = 'supervisor', n.text = 'reserve review med reserve $22,000. reserves unchanged. increased med reserve because hearing scheduled. Daniel requested more authority. ok to keep the reserve as is. paid to date approx $12,000. we should revisit after next medical.\nDOI June 29, EE got grabbed by another person during transfer at waehouse. first seen at Capital Region Occupational Health on November 24, dx strain of the rt knee, xray neg for fracture. PT at Summit Rehab & Sports PT started 12-3-2025, 12 of 12 authorized visits used so far.', n.word_count = 85, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977194-097'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977194', n.note_date = '2026-08-28', n.note_type = 'Closure / Reopen', n.author_name = 'Daniel Brooks', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Closing note August 28: Naomi back too full duty since February 16, no f/u needed. Board closed the case, nothing open.', n.word_count = 21, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977197-004'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977197', n.note_date = '2025-12-17', n.note_type = 'Contact - Employer', n.author_name = 'Olivia Grant', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Need to respond to this.\nFrom: Dev Sato <dev@metrocleanservices.example>\nSent: Wed, Dec 17, 2025 16:24\nTo: Olivia Grant\nSubject: RE: Claim 6977197 - Morris\n\nHi Olivia,\nOur insurer is STARBUCKS CORPORATION, adjuster is Olivia.\nCamila Morris has not returned our calsl about the modified duty offer.\n\nThanks,\nDev Sato', n.word_count = 49, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = true, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977197-005'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977197', n.note_date = '2025-12-17', n.note_type = 'First Report Summary', n.author_name = 'Olivia Grant', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'New assignment 12/17/25, DOI 12/15/25 at retail store. Cx says she slipped on a spill near the counter at retail store. Reported to Lena Haddad same day. Treating at Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab with Dr Lindqvist. No prior claims that I can see. Cx still working, light tasks only. C-3 not yet rec\'d. I will call Camila and the employer today. We have not rec\'d any wage info yet. Coverage confirmed, STARBUCKS CORPORATION is on the risk. We need the job description and wage statement from the employer. Claim # 6977197, Nassau county. Diary 14 days.\nDOI 12/15/25, cx slipped on a spill near the counter at retail store. On modified duty from 12/17/25. Carla Brennan is the worker\'s attorney.', n.word_count = 121, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977197-006'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977197', n.note_date = '2025-12-17', n.note_type = 'Prior Claims Check', n.author_name = 'Jamal Webb', n.author_role = 'assistant', n.text = 'prior claims check nothing under Morris. -Jamal', n.word_count = 7, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977197-007'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977197', n.note_date = '2025-12-18', n.note_type = 'Contact - Injured Worker', n.author_name = 'Olivia Grant', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Called Camila, reached on 2nd try.', n.word_count = 6, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977197-008'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977197', n.note_date = '2025-12-18', n.note_type = 'Medical Update', n.author_name = 'Dr Lindqvist', n.author_role = 'treating provider', n.text = 'OFFICE NOTE December 18 (Dr Lindqvist):\nSUBJECTIVE: pt c/o knee sore, swelling after standing. pain 8/10.\nOBJECTIVE: mild effusion, gait guarded. xray neg for fracture. ROM: knee/ankle ROM near full, some pain at end range.\nASSESSMENT: strain of the left knee, no change.\nPLAN: brace/splint prn, ice. restr: no standing over 2 hrs, no ladders, no kneeling. work status: back on light duty. f/u 1/6.', n.word_count = 65, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977197-009'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977197', n.note_date = '2025-12-18', n.note_type = 'Contact - Employer', n.author_name = 'Olivia Grant', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'Email from Dev Sato 12/18/25 The employer concerned about overtime coverage.', n.word_count = 11, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977197-010'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977197', n.note_date = '2025-12-19', n.note_type = 'Supervisor Incident Statement', n.author_name = 'Lena Haddad', n.author_role = 'ER supervisor', n.text = 'Statement 12/19/2025 from Lena Haddad at MetroClean Services: I was on shift 12/15/2025. Camila told me she slipped on a spill near the counter. No other witnesses that i know of. Location was retail store. We have a camera but not sure it covers retail store. No prior complaints that i recall. Camila finished the shift but was favoring it. I offered to call an ambulance, she said no. We did a safety huddle the next morning. I can send the schedule for that week if needed.\nDOI 12/15/2025, Camila slipped on a spill near the counter at retail store. First seen at Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab on 12/18/2025, dx strain of the left knee, xray neg for fracture. On modified duty from 12/17/2025. Carla Brennan is the worker\'s atty. Still waiting on wage statement from the company and initial medical report from Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab.', n.word_count = 149, n.has_copied_history = true, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977197-011'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977197', n.note_date = '2025-12-19', n.note_type = 'Contact - Provider', n.author_name = 'Olivia Grant', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = '12/19/25 - Dr Lindqvist\'s office Asked Dr Lindqvist for an updated work status, fax request sent Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab billing called about a denied visit, referred to STARBUCKS CORPORATION Hudson Valley Ortho & Rehab rec\'d our auth, visits scheduled.', n.word_count = 41, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
MERGE (n:Note {note_id: 'SYN-6977197-012'}) SET n.claim_id = '6977197', n.note_date = '2025-12-22', n.note_type = 'Work Status', n.author_name = 'Olivia Grant', n.author_role = 'adjuster', n.text = 'RTW: Cx did 6 days of modified duty then called out. Dev Sato says light duty available, hours reduced. Asked Dr Lindqvist for updated work status. Cx says she isnt ready, pain 8/10. Cx worried about the commute. The employer should have the new restrictions in writing.', n.word_count = 47, n.has_copied_history = false, n.has_pasted_email = false, n.looks_truncated = false;
